# SHA-256 for every frozen resource, and benchmark-results/ filenames are content
# hashes. Any end-of-line translation changes those bytes, so a fresh clone with
# the default core.autocrlf=true on Windows fails hash verification.
# Line-ending conversion is disabled repository-wide. Do not narrow this.
* -text
